Guitar UI Experience:

A front-end project showcasing interactive guitar-related UI components, including accordions, tabs, rotators, and scroll-based navigation. This project is a work in progress and will expand as new components are added.

Current Features
- Banner image
- Nav bar with links to future sections
- Interactive accordion sections (Benefits, Accessories)
- Custom diamond icons with active state toggling
- Smooth scroll behavior with scroll-margin offset
- Fretboard-inspired UI styling

Acoustic Guitar Tabs Component(New Section):

A reusable, self contained tab section representing six common acoustic guitar body styles.  This section contains the HTML, CSS and Javascript needed to render and control the tab interface.

- HTML: markup for tab buttons and panels
- CSS: spacing, colors, images, active tab states, hover effects
- Javascript: reusable tab component logic
    * Querying tab buttons and tab panels
    * Managing active states
    * Ensures only one tab open at a time
This component is designed to present acoustic guitar body types in a clean and interactive layout.  It will also serve as a reusable component that can be used for a future electric guitar tab section.

Tech Stack
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

Running the Project
Open index.html in a browser or use a local server (Live Server, etc.)

Work in Progress
More sections and UI components will be added as development continues.

